WEBVTT

NOTE Authored baseline guidance. Offline synthetic Flite SLT narration. Sentence timing measured from exact PCM frames and verified with FFprobe; not word/phoneme alignment.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.370
Authored guidance, with offline synthetic narration.

2
00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:08.030
This inline-four teaching engine starts at twelve
hundred revolutions per minute.

3
00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:13.280
One, three, four, two is our chosen firing order,
not every car's.

4
00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:17.740
Watch paired pistons and half-speed cams across the
four-stroke cycle.

5
00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:20.345
Motion is slowed sixty times.

6
00:00:20.595 --> 00:00:25.075
Pause and select any declared part, then pull it or
use the slider.

7
00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:29.045
Put it back, or cancel to restore the inspection
entry.

8
00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:32.565
Reset returns phase to zero, keeping settings.

9
00:00:32.815 --> 00:00:36.205
Keep a comparison and change prescribed speed or
bore.

10
00:00:36.455 --> 00:00:41.460
Speed changes rates; bore changes displacement, not
simulated torque.

11
00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:43.780
Pulling is inspection only.

12
00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:47.570
Own-account questions remain held by profile policy.

